>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.3.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">February 10th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Obtainable</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<blockquote><p><i>All you could ever need for spacious storage! Beautiful oak planks for holding up all your resources.</i></p></blockquote>\n<p>The <b>Sellner Explorer</b> is a vehicle that can be purchased from <a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">The Oak Depot</a> for $27,000. It is a large heavy-duty pickup truck.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\">Details</span></h2>\n<p>The Sellner Explorer is a vehicle well suited for hauling cargo. Its bed measures 7 by 14 studs, with the guards on the side having a depth of 5 studs. However, the tailgate is only 2 studs tall. Unlike other vehicles, the Explorer is virtually unaffected by going off-road, while still maintaining a relatively high speed at all times. Only the <a href=\"/wiki/Oakmobile\" title=\"Oakmobile\">Oakmobile</a> consistently outspeeds the Explorer.\n</p><p>The Explorer comes in a total of 24 colors; 12 common and 12 rare. The common colors include pink, black, gray, purple, bronze, teal, turquoise, sand yellow, olive green, sage green, dark gray, light gray. The rare colors include white, vibrant red, gold/orange, Pyrite yellow, lime green, vibrant green, cyan, vibrant light blue, vibrant blue, vibrant purple, Magnetite purple, and cherry red/pink. All the common colors possess equal rarity, as do the rare colors; however, unboxing a rare color possesses a 1 in 100 chance. Additionally, there are neon variants of both the common and rare colors. Unboxing a neon common color possesses a 1 in 10,000 chance, and unboxing a neon rare color a 1 in 1,000,000 chance.\n</p><p>The Explorer's spawn pad measures 31 by 0.65 by 15 studs.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Prior to v1.52.0, the Explorer was $18,025</li>\n<li>In v1.52.0, the Explorer was $36,050</li>\n<li>In v1.54.3, the Explorer's model changed.</li>\n<li>An Explorer can be found sunken in a lake in Ferwater near where the <a href=\"/wiki/Pirate_Boat\" title=\"Pirate Boat\">Pirate Boat</a> spawns.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903044150\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.036 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.046 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 71/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 72/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.007/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019456/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   37.956      1 Template:Vehicles\n100.00%   37.956      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:1101-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903044150 and revision id 21573. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Vehicles"],"links":[{"title":"Oakmobile","exists":true},{"title":"Pirate Boat","exists":true},{"title":"The Oak Depot","exists":true}],"im